  "story": {
    "day": 172,
    "title": "Kaya's Rainy Day Dreams",
    "sentences": [
      "It was a rainy Saturday morning for Kaya.",
      "She practiced calligraphy and read a book.",
      "Kaya found an octopus story from the public library.",
      "It had a million words, but she couldn't answer them all.",
      "Kaya looked forward to hiking and seeing animals.",
      "“We'll certainly climb that hill,” her dad said.",
      "They'll spot a horse, a koala, a zebra, or a dolphin.",
      "For dinner, mom cooked curry with potato and corn.",
      "It needed carrot, cabbage, mushroom, and one ounce of tomato.",
      "“She'll heat the spaghetti now,” mom said at 6 p.m.",
      "“You'll get dessert, but we mustn't borrow more!”",
      "Kaya, wearing her new ring, felt quite like dancing and skating."
    ]
  }
